00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,520
Gregor Mendel, a monk in Brno, worked on the garden pea from eighteen fifty six to eighteen sixty three, and published in eighteen sixty six.

2
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:17,708
Nobody understood him until nineteen hundred, when de Vries, Correns and Tschermak rediscovered his work.

3
00:00:17,708 --> 00:00:20,585
He succeeded because of four decisions.

